 "stimulus_html": "<ol class=\"os-raise-noindent\" start=\"3\">\n  <li>Three different equations are given. Refer to these equations to complete questions a–f.</li>\n</ol>\n<table class=\"os-raise-wideequaltable unnumbered\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"col\">Equation</th>\n<th scope=\"col\"><span data-math=\"x\">x</span>-intercept</th>\n<th scope=\"col\"><span data-math=\"x\">x</span>-coordinate of the vertex</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span data-math=\"y=x(x-2)\">y=x(x-2)</span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p>a. _____</p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p>b. _____</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span data-math=\"y=(x-4)(x+5)\">y=(x-4)(x+5)</span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p>c. _____</p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p>d. _____</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span data-math=\"y=-5x(3-x)\">y=-5x(3-x)</span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p>e. _____</p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p>f. _____</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
